### Mail - Create

POST {{baseUrl}}/mail
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderId": "{{senderId}}",
  "recipientIds": {{recipientIds}},
  "ccIds": {{ccIds}},
  "bccIds": {{bccIds}},
  "subject": "{{subject}}",
  "body": "{{body}}",
  "threadId": "{{threadId}}",
  "isReply": {{isReply}},
  "forwarded": {{forwarded}},
  "attachments": {{attachments}}
}
